{"text":"In large part, people will argue, and again, there's unfortunately not enough time to delve into detail in my remarks, but people will argue that the gains from globalization have far too much accrued to the holders of capital and not to labor, and that has been problematic. But as we look to the future and think about the risks of automation and broadening inequality, I believe public policy will need to focus much more on this area. A third area, I beg your pardon, fourth area, so I've talked about technology, I've talked about demographics, talked about inequality. Fourth area naturally is the climate risks and climate challenges that we continue to face.","words":[{"text":"In","start":0.0,"end":0.48},{"text":"large","start":0.48,"end":0.82},{"text":"part","start":0.82,"end":1.4,"punct":","},{"text":"people","start":2.42,"end":2.52},{"text":"will","start":2.52,"end":2.84},{"text":"argue","start":2.84,"end":3.28,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":3.7,"end":3.92},{"text":"again","start":3.92,"end":4.16,"punct":","},{"text":"there's","start":4.28,"end":4.42},{"text":"unfortunately","start":4.42,"end":5.14},{"text":"not","start":5.14,"end":5.38},{"text":"enough","start":5.38,"end":5.64},{"text":"time","start":5.64,"end":5.86},{"text":"to","start":5.86,"end":6.24},{"text":"delve","start":6.24,"end":6.52},{"text":"into","start":6.52,"end":6.84},{"text":"detail","start":6.84,"end":7.36},{"text":"in","start":7.36,"end":8.22},{"text":"my","start":8.22,"end":8.42},{"text":"remarks","start":8.42,"end":8.84,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":9.36,"end":9.5},{"text":"people","start":9.5,"end":9.82},{"text":"will","start":9.82,"end":10.02},{"text":"argue","start":10.02,"end":10.34},{"text":"that","start":10.34,"end":10.58},{"text":"the","start":10.58,"end":10.78},{"text":"gains","start":10.78,"end":11.12},{"text":"from","start":11.12,"end":11.42},{"text":"globalization","start":11.42,"end":12.06},{"text":"have","start":12.06,"end":12.6},{"text":"far","start":12.6,"end